### Manager Review Leave Request
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/leave/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaveId": "3f148ad5-2417-46a0-b4d1-6d1dd1fe66e6",
  "reviewerId": "b4bcc759-5be2-45c9-9d69-fa822cac71d7",
  "action": "APPROVED",
  "reviewerRemarks": "Medical certificate verified. Approved for rest."
}

### Log Project Progress Milestone
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/projects/progress-log
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectCode": "PRJ-2026",
  "reporterId": "a1f19022-7741-441b-bf31-001a923e97ba",
  "completionPercentage": 45.50,
  "progressSummary": "Database persistence tables initialized and backend routing layers verified via integration tests."
}

### Log In and Remember This Device (returns session.token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.staff@nextan.com.sg",
  "password": "<password>",
  "trustDevice": true,
  "portal": "staff"
}

### Resume a Remembered Sign-in (returns a new token; the old one stops working)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/resume
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "<session.token>"
}

### List My Remembered Devices
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/sessions
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>

### Sign Out All My Other Devices
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/sessions/revoke
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "allOthers": true
}

### Log Out (ends this device's session)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>

### Undo a Leave Decision (manager, within 10 minutes; back to PENDING)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/leave/undo-review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaveId": "<leave_id>",
  "reviewerId": "<manager user_id>"
}
